WEBVTT

00:09:58.427 --> 00:10:00.971
but there was basically nobody
there because of COVID.

00:10:00.971 --> 00:10:05.225
(Laughter)

00:10:05.601 --> 00:10:08.812
And still, running onto that field,

00:10:08.854 --> 00:10:11.482
I had so many mixed emotions.

00:10:12.816 --> 00:10:13.984
What a rush.

00:10:15.903 --> 00:10:17.655
But to be honest,

00:10:17.655 --> 00:10:19.990
I was absolutely terrified.

00:10:21.033 --> 00:10:24.411
Practice was one thing, but a real game?

00:10:24.828 --> 00:10:26.664
Was my leg going to hold up?

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:29.333
I found out on the third snap

00:10:29.333 --> 00:10:32.294
when this huge defender
launched himself onto my back,